<h2>Registration pending payment</h2>
<p>A new attendee has registered and is expected to pay via the ticket vendor.</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Email:</strong> {{ email }}</li>
  {% if full_name %}<li><strong>Name:</strong> {{ full_name }}</li>{% endif %}
  {% if serial %}<li><strong>Registration number:</strong> {{ serial }}</li>{% endif %}
  {% if sid %}<li><strong>Submission ID:</strong> {{ sid }}</li>{% endif %}
</ul>
<p>
  This registrant stays in "pending payment" until a matching ticket purchase
  is retrieved from the vendor. If they paid with a different name or email,
  use the dashboard to link the payment manually instead.
</p>
